{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>Your ewes and your goats were not bereft.</b> By my merit, in the manner of what is written (Exodus 23:26): ״לא תהיה משכלה ועקרה בארצך״." "<b>And the rams of your flock I did not eat.</b> As is the way of shepherds, in the manner of what is written (Ezekiel 34:3): ״אֶת הַחֵלֶב תֹּאכֵלוּ וְאֶת הַצֶּמֶר תִּלְבָּשׁוּ הַבְּרִיאָה תִּזְבָּחוּ הַצֹּאן לֹא תִרְעוּ״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:16:44.709812210Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}